cuems-common (1.3.0-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix 10-ethernet0.link Path= to N97 default (pci-0000:01:00.0; was
    pci-0000:03:00.0 which is the wifi slot on controller hardware).
    Adds link-files.README documenting the hardware-mismatch hazard.

 -- Ion Reguera <ion@stagelab.coop>  Wed, 20 May 2026 21:04:42 +0200

cuems-common (1.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Network logic fixes: check-ip.sh exit code, ExecStop teardown,
    hostapd wifi0 bond detach, wifi-auto.sh dynamic-interface rewrite,
    central /etc/cuems/ap.conf, WoL re-enabled on ethernet .link files
    (regression fix).

